>> title: Dirty Rice
>> category: Rice, Beans & Grains
>> tags: rice, pork, cajun, one-pot
>> counters: Meat and Three, One Pot
>> aka: rice dressing, Cajun rice dressing
>> servings: 6
>> time: 1 hr

>> step: brown 10 min
Brown @ground pork{8%oz}(225 g) and @chicken livers{8%oz}(225 g; finely chopped) in a #Dutch oven{} for ~{10%min}.

>> step: sweat 8 min
Sweat @&(~1)meat{} with @yellow onion{1%medium}, @green bell pepper{1}, @celery{2%ribs}, and @garlic{3%cloves} for ~{8%min}.

>> step: toast 2 min
Toast @&(~1)base{} with @long-grain white rice{1 1/2%cups}(300 g) and @Cajun seasoning{1%Tbs} for ~{2%min}.

>> step: simmer covered 25 min
Simmer @&(~1)rice{} covered over low heat for ~{25%min} with @chicken stock{2 3/4%cups}(650 mL) and @kosher salt{1%tsp}.

>> step: fluff, fold in
Fluff @&(~1)rice{} with a #fork{} and fold in @scallions{3}(sliced).
